2026-07-27T08:55:59.1527649Z i /tmp/RtmpLZYJpO/duckdb
2026-07-27T08:55:59.1527968Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T08:55:59.1528373Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T08:55:59.1529087Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T08:55:59.1529569Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T08:55:59.1530278Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T08:55:59.1530797Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
